    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Ballistic Showdown</strong> is an online multiplayer game where you fight others with various power-ups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos &amp; Explosions</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight others and get to the top of the leaderboard, using the powerful power-ups to defeat your enemies, and climb the leaderboard!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some of the power-ups which the game has:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bomb: Explode in a radius to damage enemies</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sniper: Quick but small projectile that deals a lot but is hard to use</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Wave: Large &amp; slow projectile that damages less but is easier to use</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dash: Boost yourself in the direction you are facing</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shield: A shield that wears out after receiving a hit</li></ul><br>What sets great players apart is their skill in movement and mastering the power-ups. enter an Arena and defeat your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Arenas</h2>In online arenas, you will fight a maximum of 10 other players. The game is made in a custom engine with custom servers for an optimal online experience and cheat detection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord Server</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/f346f87792483a21795099cb33a81d49.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Ballistic Showdown</strong> is an online multiplayer game where you fight others with various power-ups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaos &amp; Explosions</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/37c0004a4e3d7b23865dcabe56a141ec.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight others and get to the top of the leaderboard, using the powerful power-ups to defeat your enemies, and climb the leaderboard!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.poster.avif?t=1729970944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.webm?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560060/extras/0721c1e65327cc24fb312b62f6b5202d.mp4?t=1729970944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some of the power-ups which the game has:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bomb: Explode in a radius to damage enemies</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sniper: Quick but small projectile that deals a lot but is hard to use</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Wave: Large &amp; slow projectile that damages less but is easier to use</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dash: Boost yourself in the direction you are facing</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shield: A shield that wears out after receiving a hit</li></ul><br>What sets great players apart is their skill in movement and mastering the power-ups. enter an Arena and defeat your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Arenas</h2>In online arenas, you will fight a maximum of 10 other players. The game is made in a custom engine with custom servers for an optimal online experience and cheat detection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord Server</h2>",
    "short_description": "Ballistic Showdown \u2013 An ultra-satisfying, fast-paced, 2-10 player, arena-based, multiplayer, top-down 2D shooter. Grab what you can and battle it out with 2-10 players, heavily inspired by retro and arena shooters.",
